### ============================================================
### DAILY WAGE FLOW
### Requires: auth.http's poster complete-profile run, and
### seeker complete-profile run with the daily_wage block active.
### ============================================================

### Create job (poster) — daily_wage, all currently-required fields included
POST {{jobBaseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobTitle": "Test Job",
  "description": "Testing the current daily_wage workflow end to end",
  "category": "plumbing",
  "jobType": "one-time",
  "workflowType": "daily_wage",
  "location": { "address": "Chennai", "lat": 13.08, "lng": 80.27 },
  "salary": { "amount": 500, "type": "fixed" },
  "minExperience": 1,
  "numberOfOpenings": 1,
  "applicationDeadline": "{{$datetime iso8601 3 d}}",
  "workMode": "on-site",
  "jobContactPhone": "9000011111",
  "postingAttested": true,
  "foodProvided": false,
  "transportationProvided": false,
  "workStartDate": "{{$datetime iso8601 2 d}}",
  "workEndDate": "{{$datetime iso8601 2 d}}",
  "workingHoursStart": "09:00",
  "workingHoursEnd": "18:00",
  "instructionsText": "Bring your own tools, main switch is in the hallway",
  "instructionsDurationMinutes": 0.5
}

### Accept job (seeker)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

### Poster accepts the candidate — starts the instructions timer
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/accept-candidate
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}

### Seeker starts work — only works once the timer (instructions.readyAt) has passed
### With 0.5 min (30s) duration above, wait 30+ seconds after accept-candidate before running this
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/start-work
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

### Upload a proof file first (auth-service GridFS) — copy the returned fileId
### into the proofFileId variable in settings.json before running submit-proof below.
POST {{authBaseUrl}}/../uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitBoundary

------WebKitBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="proof.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample-files/proof.jpg
------WebKitBoundary--

### Submit proof (seeker) — needs fileId + filename from the upload response above
POST {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/submit-proof
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileId": "{{proofFileId}}",
  "filename": "proof.jpg",
  "note": "Work completed as instructed"
}

### Confirm completion — seeker first
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

### Confirm completion — poster second
### This single call auto-finalizes the job (status -> completed, commission
### set, reputation/invoice updated). There is no separate /finalize request
### anymore - do not add one back.
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}


### ============================================================
### MID-LEVEL FLOW
### Requires: auth.http's poster complete-profile run, and
### seeker complete-profile run with the mid_level block active
### (comment out daily_wage, uncomment mid_level in auth.http first).
### ============================================================

### Create job (poster) — mid_level
POST {{jobBaseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobTitle": "Backend Developer",
  "description": "Build and maintain REST APIs for our platform",
  "category": "Software Development",
  "jobType": "full-time",
  "workflowType": "mid_level",
  "location": { "address": "Trichy", "lat": 10.79, "lng": 78.70 },
  "salary": { "amount": 85000, "type": "fixed" },
  "minExperience": 3,
  "numberOfOpenings": 1,
  "applicationDeadline": "{{$datetime iso8601 3 d}}",
  "workMode": "hybrid",
  "jobContactPhone": "9000022222",
  "postingAttested": true,
  "requiredSkills": ["Node.js", "MongoDB", "Express"],
  "reviewTimerDurationMinutes": 0.5,
  "minClientProjectExperience": 1,
  "minTeamSizeExperience": 2
}

### Accept job (seeker)
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

### Poster accepts the candidate — status moves to "confirmed"
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/accept-candidate
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}

### Poster reviews the candidate's profile (fetches from auth-service)
GET {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/seeker-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}

### Poster submits review — moves status to "verifying"
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/review-candidate
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "posterEmail": "poster@test.com"
}

### Poster schedules the meeting — moves status to "connecting"
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/schedule-meeting
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meetingDate": "{{$datetime iso8601 1 d}}",
  "meetingLink": "https://meet.example.com/test-room"
}

### Seeker confirms attendance — this alone is enough now, no separate readiness timer step
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/confirm-attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

### Confirm completion — seeker first
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{seekerToken}}

### Confirm completion — poster second
### Auto-finalizes: status -> completed, commission set (flat, 1500), reputation
### updated, invoice flag set on poster since commission is unpaid. No separate
### /finalize request exists.
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}

### Poster pays the resulting invoice
PATCH {{jobBaseUrl}}/{{jobId}}/pay-invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{posterToken}}


### ============================================================
### LEADERSHIP FLOW
### Requires: auth.http's poster complete-profile run, and
### seeker complete-profile run with the leadership block active
### (comment out daily_wage/mid_level, uncomment leadership in auth.http first).
